age-ids="cf6cd2ab-bd40-4818-a2ca-18194cc75cea cf6cd2ab-bd40-4818-a2ca-18194cc75cea"><h4 class="sr-only m-0 select-none print:not-sr-only print:mt-4 print:mb-2 print:text-xs print:leading-normal print:font-bold" data-conversation-role="assistant" tabindex="-1">ChatGPT disse:</h4><div><div class="group flex min-w-0 flex-col" data-chatgpt-selection-conversation-id="local-chatgpt:83acd1ba-f0f3-4663-94ac-4615085b56de" data-chatgpt-selection-message-id="cf6cd2ab-bd40-4818-a2ca-18194cc75cea"><span hidden=""></span><div data-selected-text-overlay-target="_r_4lt_" dir="auto" data-markdown-text-style="assistant-message" class="MarkdownRoot-rZKhxa [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;ol:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;ul:first-child]:mt-0" style="--markdown-link-color: currentColor;"><div class="my-4 first:mt-0 last:mb-0 empty:hidden" data-dil-source-message-id="cf6cd2ab-bd40-4818-a2ca-18194cc75cea" data-chatgpt-copy-reference="0" data-markdown-copy="contents"><div class="[--entity-prose-inset:0px]"><div hidden=""></div><div class="relative PortalBoundary-TFj9W2 Renderer-ojZscX" data-theme="dark" style="--puik-portal-zoom: 1;"><div dir="auto" class="DilRenderer-tB76Jj DilResponseRoot-HfQrEh Reveal-k2IWvM" data-d-inline-reveal="" data-d-direction="col" data-dil-message-id="cf6cd2ab-bd40-4818-a2ca-18194cc75cea"><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">Sim, é exatamente essa parte!</span> 👍</p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Na sua imagem, o código antigo da viatura começa na linha <span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">831</span>.</p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Faça assim:</p><ol class="List-rH8nmc" data-d-component="list" data-d-marker="number" data-d-marker-layout="native" style="--d-list-row-gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0);"><li class="Item-O8JWQe" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-OKAHK6"><div class="Label-B5tj_e" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Selecione desde o comentário <code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code">// A viatura fica sempre atrás, acompanha as mudanças de faixa e pisca o giroflex.</code> (linha 831).</p></div></div></li><li class="Item-O8JWQe" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-OKAHK6"><div class="Label-B5tj_e" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Apague até a linha <code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code">police.blueLight.material.emissiveIntensity = sirenPulse ? 0.25 : 3.6;</code> (linha 838).</p></div></div></li><li class="Item-O8JWQe" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-OKAHK6"><div class="Label-B5tj_e" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Cole no lugar o <span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">segundo código</span> que te mandei, o que começa com <code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code">// A viatura persegue o jogador e verifica os carros à frente.</code></p></div></div></li></ol><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">Não apague</span> o trecho <code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code">const positions = snow.geometry.attributes.position;</code> nem o código da neve que vem logo depois.</p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">A função <code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code">createPoliceCar(x, z)</code> é outra parte do arquivo, mais acima. Para deixar a viatura mais realista, você também precisa substituir aquela função pelo primeiro código que te passei.</p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Salve com <code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code">Ctrl + S</code> e teste o jogo.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><span hidden=""></span></div></div><div class="mt-1.5 flex turn-action-controls min-h-5 min-w-0 max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-wrap items-center justify-start gap-0.5 browser:-ms-0.5 browser:mt-3 electron:-translate-x-1 extension:-translate-x-1.5 [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-2 [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-ring [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-offset-0 [--side-tooltip:bottom]"><div class="flex min-h-5 min-w-0 flex-wrap items-center gap-0.5 browser:gap-0"><span data-state="closed" class="contents"><button type="button" class="no-drag cursor-interaction items-center select-none disabled:cursor-default aria-disabled:cursor-default focus:outline-hidden disabled:opacity-40 aria-disabled:opacity-40 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-0 whitespace-nowrap flex border gap-1 rounded-full electron:rounded-md text-tertiary not-disabled:not-aria-disabled:hover:bg-primary-ghost-hover data-[state=open]:bg-primary-ghost-hover border-transparent electron:p-1 electron:[&amp;&gt;svg]:icon-sm flex items-center justify-center p-0.5" aria-label="Copiar"><svg width="21" height="21" viewBox="0 0 21 21" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon-xs"><path d="M13.468 11.1216C13.468 10.4107 13.468 9.91717 13.4367 9.53369C13.4137 9.25191 13.3758 9.0622 13.3244 8.91846L13.2687 8.78858C13.1148 8.48652 12.88