7.93949 15.9033 8.04961 15.8629L8.20293 15.8014C8.35464 15.7349 8.49956 15.6538 8.63652 15.5602L8.78399 15.4498C8.93677 15.3239 9.12233 15.1398 9.47149 14.7907L14.4588 9.80238L11.2332 6.57679L6.2459 11.5651ZM15.7635 5.27308C14.9282 4.43776 13.6058 4.38573 12.7098 5.11683L12.5369 5.27308L12.1736 5.63636L15.4002 8.86195L15.7635 8.49964L15.9197 8.32581C16.6016 7.48961 16.6016 6.28311 15.9197 5.44691L15.7635 5.27308Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></button></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="block-BQZwFn"><span hidden="" data-chatgpt-agent-turn-start=""></span><div data-content-search-unit-key="fallback-turn-5:2:assistant" data-chatgpt-search-unit-key="fallback-turn-5:2:assistant" data-chatgpt-search-message-ids="5c8c99b4-6cc4-4383-82ae-ce0cdd441024 5c8c99b4-6cc4-4383-82ae-ce0cdd441024"><h4 class="sr-only m-0 select-none print:not-sr-only print:mt-4 print:mb-2 print:text-xs print:leading-normal print:font-bold" data-conversation-role="assistant" tabindex="-1">ChatGPT disse:</h4><div><div class="group flex min-w-0 flex-col" data-chatgpt-selection-conversation-id="local-chatgpt:83acd1ba-f0f3-4663-94ac-4615085b56de" data-chatgpt-selection-message-id="5c8c99b4-6cc4-4383-82ae-ce0cdd441024"><span hidden=""></span><div data-selected-text-overlay-target="_r_4cs_" dir="auto" data-markdown-text-style="assistant-message" class="MarkdownRoot-rZKhxa [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;ol:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;ul:first-child]:mt-0" style="--markdown-link-color: currentColor;"><div class="my-4 first:mt-0 last:mb-0 empty:hidden" data-dil-source-message-id="5c8c99b4-6cc4-4383-82ae-ce0cdd441024" data-chatgpt-copy-reference="1" data-markdown-copy="contents"><div class="[--entity-prose-inset:0px]"><div hidden=""></div><div class="relative PortalBoundary-TFj9W2 Renderer-ojZscX" data-theme="dark" style="--puik-portal-zoom: 1;"><div dir="auto" class="DilRenderer-tB76Jj DilResponseRoot-HfQrEh Reveal-k2IWvM" data-d-inline-reveal="" data-d-direction="col" data-dil-message-id="5c8c99b4-6cc4-4383-82ae-ce0cdd441024"><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Vamos transformar a perseguição em algo mais realista: a viatura vai tentar ultrapassar os carros do trânsito sem atravessá-los, vai se aproximar quando você estiver devagar e poderá alcançar seu carro se você não conseguir fugir.</p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">O problema do código anterior é que ele verificava se havia espaço, mas não impedia todas as sobreposições durante o movimento. Vamos corrigir isso e melhorar o comportamento da perseguição.</p><h2 class="TextBase-hXhSqg Title-HRvkwB" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="lg" data-d-weight="semibold">1. Substitua o bloco da perseguição</h2><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">No <code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code">java/script.js</code>, dentro de <code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code">animate()</code>, substitua todo o bloco da viatura — desde o comentário que começa com <code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code">// A viatura</code> até a alteração da intensidade das luzes do giroflex — pelo código abaixo.</p><div><div class="CodeBlock-zu1QM3"><div data-code-block="true" data-markdown-copy="code-block" data-theme="dark" class="relative Root-iW7ipz w-full min-w-0 contain-inline-size overflow-clip rounded-(--radius-3xl-base) border border-subtle text-default CodeSurface-UAMd1A Surface-BCuIs1 dark @container" data-search-result-target=""><div data-markdown-copy="exclude" contenteditable="false" class="flex items-center font-sans text-sm select-none ActionBar-KWWAct min-h-12 gap-2 py-1.5 ps-4 pe-1.5 font-medium text-default md:ps-5 sticky z-10 StickyActionBar-RZfVQh"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="Icon-X4VkKC" focusable="false" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="20" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><use href="/cdn/assets/icons-9df9ab66b410511a.svg#code-light-20" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><div class="min-w-0 flex-1 truncate">JavaScript</div><div class="ms-auto flex items-center min-w-0 max-w-full"><div data-code-block-controls="true" role="presentation" class="flex items-center gap-px print:hidden flex-wrap justify-end"><span data-state="closed" class="contents"><button type="button" class="no-drag cursor-interaction items-center select-none disabled:cursor-default aria-disabled:cursor-default focus:outline-hidden disabled:opacity-40 aria-disabled:opacity-40 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-0 whitespace-nowrap flex border gap-1 rounded-full text-default not-disabled:not-aria-disabled:hover:bg-primary-ghost-hover data-[state=open]:bg-primary-ghost-hover border-transparent h-9 gap-1.5 border-0 px-2 py-0 text-sm leading-5 aspect-square shrink-0 items-center justify-center !px-0" aria-label="Ativar quebra de linha" aria-pressed="false"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="Icon-X4VkKC" focusable="false" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="20" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><use href="/cdn/assets/icons-9df9ab66b410511a.svg#text-overflow-light-20" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></span><span data-state="closed" class="contents"><button type="button" class="no-drag cursor-interaction items-center select-none disabled:cursor-default aria-disabled:cursor-default focus:outline-hidden disabled:opacity-40 aria-disabled:opacity-40 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-0 whitespace-nowrap flex border gap-1 rounded-full text-default not-disabled:not-aria-disabled:hover:bg-primary-ghost-hover data-[state=open]:bg-primary-ghost-hover border-transparent h-9 gap-1.5 border-0 px-2 py-0 text-sm leading-5 aspect-square shrink-0 items-center justify-center !px-0" aria-label="Copiar código"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="Icon-X4VkKC" focusable="false" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="20" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><use href="/cdn/assets/icons-9df9ab66b410511a.svg#square-on-square-light-20" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></span></div></div></div><div class="relative [container-type:inline-size]"><div class="InlineCodePane-EYx4bd w-full overflow-x-hidden"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full Viewer-ALA646" dir="ltr"><div class="chatgpt-code-scrollport flex w-full items-stretch overscroll-x-contain Scrollport-kY3Nlm overflow-x-auto"><pre class="m-0 flex-1 cursor-text px-4 pb-3 font-mono text-size-code text-default md:px-5 ViewerContent-Cg8AgN pt-0 min-w-max whitespace-pre"><code><span class="Comment-dh5VVn">// Perseguição policial com desvio de trânsito e captura do jogador.</span><span>
</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">const</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">policeGroup</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">=</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">police</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">.</span><span>group;
</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">const</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">policeZBefore</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">=</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">policeGroup</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">.</span><span>position</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">.</span><span>z;
</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">const</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">desiredX</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">=</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">THREE</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">.</span><span>MathUtils</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">.</span><span>clamp(
  </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">player</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">.</span><span>position</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">.</span><span>x </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">+</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">2.35</span><span>,
  </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">-</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">4.5</span><span>,
  </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">4.5</span><span>
);

</span><span class="Comment-dh5VVn">// Verifica se uma posição ocuparia o espaço de outro carro.</span><span>
</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">function</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">policePositionBlocked</span><span>(</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">x</span><span>, </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">z</span><span>) {
  </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">return</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">traffic</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">.</span><span>some((</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">car</span><span>) =&gt; {
    </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">const</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">dx</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">=</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">Math</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">.</span><span>abs(</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">car</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">.</span><span>position</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">.</span><span>x </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">-</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">x</span><span>);
    </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">const</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">dz</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">=</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">Math</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">.</span><span>abs(</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">car</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">.</span><span>position</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">.</span><span>z </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">-</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">z</span><span>);

    </span><span class="Comment-dh5VVn">// Margem extra para evitar que as carrocerias se atravessem.</span><span>
    </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">return</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">dx</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">&lt;</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">1.95</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">&amp;&amp;</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">dz</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">&lt;</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">3.0</span><span>;
  });
}

</span><span class="Comment-dh5VVn">// Escolhe uma faixa livre para a viatura.</span><span>
</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">const</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">lanes</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">=</span><span> [</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">-</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">4.2</span><span>, </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">0</span><span>, </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">4.2</span><span>, </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">desiredX</span><span>]</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">.</span><span>sort(
  (</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">a</span><span>, </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">b</span><span>) =&gt; </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">Math</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">.</span><span>abs(</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">a</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">-</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">desiredX</span><span>) </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">-</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">Math</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">.</span><span>abs(</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">b</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">-</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">desiredX</span><span>)
);

</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">let</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">targetX</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">=</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">policeGroup</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">.</span><span>position</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">.</span><span>x;
</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">let</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">laneFound</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">=</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">false</span><span>;

</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">for</span><span> (</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">const</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">lane</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">of</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">lanes</span><span>) {
  </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">if</span><span> (</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">!</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">policePositionBlocked</span><span>(</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">lane</span><span>, </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">policeGroup</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">.</span><span>position</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">.</span><span>z)) {
    </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">targetX</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">=</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">lane</span><span>;
    </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">laneFound</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">=</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">true</span><span>;
    </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">break</span><span>;
  }
}

</span><span class="Comment-dh5VVn">// Só muda de faixa se o caminho até ela estiver livre.</span><span>
</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">if</span><span> (</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">laneFound</span><span>) {
  </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">const</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">nextX</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">=</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">THREE</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">.</span><span>MathUtils</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">.</span><span>damp(
