ata-d-direction="col" data-d-inline="" aria-label="Open baixar o modelo de viatura aqui" role="link" tabindex="0" style="gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0); display: inline;"><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-inline=""><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-inline="" data-d-text-decoration="underline-dotted" style="color: inherit;">baixar o modelo de viatura </span><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-has-width="true" data-d-inline="" style="color: inherit; width: max-content;"><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-inline="" data-d-text-decoration="underline-dotted" style="color: inherit;">aqui</span><svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" data-rtl-flip="" class="InlineIcon-KLrnew" data-d-component="icon" data-d-inline="" style="display: inline-block; vertical-align: calc(0.5cap - 0.5em);"><path d="M16.2256 6.99994C16.6534 7 17 7.34654 17 7.77436V14.817C17 15.2449 16.6534 15.5914 16.2256 15.5915C15.7977 15.5915 15.4512 15.2449 15.4512 14.817V9.6437L8.32182 16.773C8.0193 17.0756 7.52944 17.0755 7.2269 16.773C6.92437 16.4705 6.92437 15.9807 7.2269 15.6781L14.3562 8.54878H9.1829C8.75505 8.54878 8.40848 8.20221 8.40848 7.77436C8.40848 7.34651 8.75505 6.99994 9.1829 6.99994H16.2256Z"></path></svg></span></span></span></span>.</p></div></div></li><li class="Item-O8JWQe" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-OKAHK6"><div class="Label-B5tj_e" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Sua estrutura deve ficar assim:</p></div></div></li></ol><div><div class="CodeBlock-zu1QM3"><div data-code-block="true" data-markdown-copy="code-block" data-theme="dark" class="relative Root-iW7ipz w-full min-w-0 contain-inline-size 