r.\",\"left\",\"bd28fb49-9878-4928-a4ac-8aa70a8b4b36\",[1055],\"Vou te ensinar passo a passo! 😊 Para colocar o modelo 3D no **Speed Rush 3D**, você precisa baixar um modelo de carro no formato `.glb` e substituir o arquivo vazio `carro.glb` que está na sua pasta `models`.\\n\\n## 1. Baixe um modelo 3D de carro\\n\\nVocê pode encontrar modelos gratuitos nestes sites:\\n\\n\u003cbox gap={3}\u003e\\n  \u003crow align=\\\"center\\\" gap={3}\u003e\\n    \u003cAsyncImage query=\\\"Sketchfab downloadable free Ferrari 458 Italia 3D model\\\" aspectRatio=\\\"1:1\\\" maxWidth=\\\"100px\\\" /\u003e\\n    \u003cbox flex=\\\"1\\\" gap={1}\u003e\\n      **\u003cEntity value=\\\"Sketchfab\\\" category=\\\"organization\\\" /\u003e**\\n\\n      Modelos 3D de carros de vários tipos.\\n\\n      \u003ctext\u003e\u003cLink url=\\\"https://sketchfab.com/3d-models?features=downloadable\u0026q=ferrari%20458\\\" title=\\\"Procurar Ferrari 458 para baixar\\\" /\u003e\u003c/text\u003e\\n    \u003c/box\u003e\\n  \u003c/row\u003e\\n  \u003crow align=\\\"center\\\" gap={3}\u003e\\n    \u003cAsyncImage query=\\\"free sports car GLB 3D model\\\" aspectRatio=\\\"1:1\\\" maxWidth=\\\"100px\\\" /\u003e\\n    \u003cbox flex=\\\"1\\\" gap={1}\u003e\\n      **\u003cEntity value=\\\"Poly Pizza\\\" category=\\\"organization\\\" /\u003e**\\n\\n      Modelos 3D gratuitos, incluindo veículos.\\n\\n      \u003ctext\u003e\u003cLink url=\\\"https://poly.pizza/\\\" title=\\\"Abrir Poly Pizza\\\" /\u003e\u003c/text\u003e\\n    \u003c/box\u003e\\n  \u003c/row\u003e\\n\u003c/box\u003e\\n\\nAo escolher o modelo, procure a opção **Download** e confira se ele pode ser baixado em `.glb`. Alguns modelos exigem conta ou têm restrições de licença.\\n\\n## 2. Coloque o modelo na pasta `models`\\n\\nDepois de baixar:\\n\\n1. Se o download vier em ZIP, clique com o botão direito e escolha **Extrair tudo**.\\n2. Procure dentro da pasta extraída um arquivo terminado em `.glb`.\\n3. Copie esse arquivo.\\n4. Abra a pasta `SpeedRush/models` no Explorador de Arquivos.\\n5. Substitua o `carro.glb` vazio pelo arquivo baixado e deixe o nome exatamente como `carro.glb`.\\n\\nA estrutura ficará assim:\\n\\n\u003cbox border radius=\\\"lg\\\" padding={3} gap={2}\u003e\\n  \u003crow align=\\\"center\\\" gap={2}\u003e\\n    \u003cicon name=\\\"folder-open\\\" size=\\\"lg\\\" color=\\\"#D4A72C\\\" /\u003e\\n    **SpeedRush**\\n  \u003c/row\u003e\\n  \u003cbox padding={{left:5}} gap={2}\u003e\\n    \u003crow align=\\\"center\\\" gap={2}\u003e\\n      \u003cicon name=\\\"folder\\\" color=\\\"#D4A72C\\\" /\u003e\\n      `css/`\\n    \u003c/row\u003e\\n    \u003crow align=\\\"center\\\" gap={2}\u003e\\n      \u003cicon name=\\\"folder\\\" color=\\\"#D4A72C\\\" /\u003e\\n      `java/`\\n    \u003c/row\u003e\\n    \u003crow align=\\\"center\\\" gap={2}\u003e\\n      \u003cicon name=\\\"folder-open\\\" color=\\\"#D4A72C\\\" /\u003e\\n      `models/`\\n    \u003c/row\u003e\\n    \u003cbox padding={{left:6}} gap={2}\u003e\\n      \u003crow align=\\\"center\\\" gap={2}\u003e\\n        \u003cicon name=\\\"file-box\\\" color=\\\"#16A34A\\\" /\u003e\\n        `carro.glb`\\n      \u003c/row\u003e\\n      \u003crow align=\\\"center\\\" gap={2}\u003e\\n        \u003cicon name=\\\"file-box\\\" color=\\\"#16A34A\\\" /\u003e\\n        `policia.glb`\\n      \u003c/row\u003e\\n      \u003crow align=\\\"center\\\" gap={2}\u003e\\n        \u003cicon name=\\\"file-box\\\" color=\\\"#16A34A\\\" /\u003e\\n        `cidade.glb`\\n      \u003c/row\u003e\\n      \u003crow align=\\\"center\\\" gap={2}\u003e\\n        \u003cicon name=\\\"file-box\\\" color=\\\"#16A34A\\\" /\u003e\\n        `cones.glb`\\n      \u003c/row\u003e\\n    \u003c/box\u003e\\n    \u003crow align=\\\"center\\\" gap={2}\u003e\\n      \u003cicon name=\\\"file-code\\\" /\u003e\\n      `index.html`\\n    \u003c/row\u003e\\n  \u003c/box\u003e\\n\u003c/box\u003e\\n\\nOs outros três arquivos só precisam ser substituídos quando você baixar os respectivos modelos.\\n\\n## 3. Faça o jogo carregar o carro\\n\\nSó colocar o arquivo na pasta não basta: o `java/script.js` precisa estar configurado para carregar `models/carro.glb` usando o `GLTFLoader`.\\n\\nDepois, abra o jogo com o Live Server e teste.\\n\\n**Vamos começar pelo carro.** Baixe um modelo e, se tiver dificuldade para encontrar o arquivo `.glb`, envie aqui uma foto do que apareceu dentro da pasta baixada. Eu te digo exatamente qual arquivo copiar.\",{},{\"_438\":439,\"_440\":-5,\"_125\":1078},1792587784.092588,1792587784.259805,{\"_433\":1076,\"_119\":1077},{\"_1062\":1063,\"_1064\":677,\"_1065\":1066,\"_1067\":1068,\"_1069\":1070,\"_149\":150,\"_1071\":1072,\"_151\":11,\"_152\":822,\"_154\":155,\"_156\":823,\"_158\":823,\"_145\":146,\"_159\":146,\"_59\":60,\"_160\":11,\"_161\":1073,\"_1074\":20,\"_163\":1075},\"reasoning_status\",\"reasoning_ended\",\"finished_duration_sec\",\"reasoning_start_time\",1792587779.3890474,\"reasoning_end_time\",1792587784.0756853,\"reasoning_recap_type\",\"hide_all\",\"reasoning_group_id\",\"60a86267-2498-44a0-88e1-ca5c663a108c\",\"3ac46196-9fdd-427d-946f-21dc46b80bc4\",\"hide_inline_actions\",[],\"reasoning_recap\",\"Pensou por 4s\",{},\"a25cf657-6e7c-45f6-b58b-dd6ae7e9c128\",{\"_438\":451,\"_440\":-5,\"_125\":1087},1792587804.249,1792587791.819748,{\"_433\":434,\"_435\":1085},{\"_152\":822,\"_448\":-5,\"_156\":823,\"_158\":823,\"_160\":11},[1086],\"como eu coloco o modelo 3d\",{},\"d0f93735-8e9e-4dfa-97c9-27fc69d54854\",{\"_438\":439,\"_440\":-5,\"_125\":1124},1792587753.795599,1792587756.826075,{\"_433\":434,\"_435\":1122},{\"_131\":1094,\"_133\":20,\"_134\":1095,\"_136\":1096,\"_138\":1097,\"_140\":1098,\"_145\":146,\"_147\":1099,\"_149\":150,\"_151\":20,\"_152\":1100,\"_154\":155,\"_156\":1101,\"_158\":1101,\"_159\":146,\"_59\":60,\"_160\":20,\"_161\":1102,\"_163\":1103},{\"_177\":429,\"_430\":1121},[],[],{\"_233\":1104,\"_235\":1105,\"_237\":1106,\"_239\":124,\"_242\":1107},{},[],\"a23ef802-e9a5-45cf-a40c-82c4f21f6cda\",\"6fb6bba0-9c